  "id": "dong-quai",
  "term": "dong quai",
  "definition": "Dong quai is an herbal extract from the root of Angelica sinensis. It is described as having possible anti-inflammatory, antispasmodic, vasodilating, estrogen-like, and antitumor effects, with plant compounds that may relax smooth muscle, widen blood vessels, reduce free radicals, and affect blood clotting.",
